WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.939
Next up, let's take a look at actions,
or those behaviors that result in

00:00:04.939 --> 00:00:08.140
rewards and stem from
the triggers that you sent users.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.770
Here, you'll want to optimize your
model to eliminate your user's pain and

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.650
get them to interact with your app,

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.950
thereby increasing their
potential to spend money.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.160
Ask yourself the following questions.

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.290
Where is the most challenging
action in your product?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.480
Why is it challenging?

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:31.880
How can you test and
improve this action?

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.060
Here's a hint.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:37.070
Analytics play a huge role in finding
answers that are based on data.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.830
Take a minute and jot down how you might
use analytics to help identify and

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.410
eliminate these roadblocks.

